cmds\": [], \"name\": \"org_pubref_rules_protobuf\"}\r\nERROR: cc_toolchain_suite '@com_github_bazelbuild_bazeltoolchains//configs/ubuntu16_04_clang/1.1/bazel_0.16.1/default:toolchain' does not contain a toolchain for CPU 'k8', you may want to add an entry for 'k8|clang' into toolchains and toolchain_identifier 'linux_gnu_x86' into the corresponding cc_toolchain rule (see --incompatible_disable_cc_toolchain_label_from_crosstool_proto).\r\nINFO: Elapsed time: 9.664s\r\nINFO: 0 processes.\r\nINFO: Build Event Protocol upload finished successfully\r\nINFO: Build Event Protocol results available at https://source.cloud.google.com/results/invocations/d3599496-e498-4943-a6b3-e0c7807a0bf6\r\nFAILED: Build did NOT complete successfully (52 packages loaded)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWorkaround is to download an older version of bazel (our builds on kokoro are using on older bazel version as well, that's why the are working).\r\n```\r\nmkdir ~/bazel-0.17\r\ncd ~/bazel-0.17\r\nwget -q https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/releases/download/0.17.1/bazel-0.17.1-linux-x86_64\r\nchmod u+x bazel-0.17.1-linux-x86_64\r\n# use the 0.17 bazel binary for running RBE builds and things will work fine\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/17422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/17422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]